  "confidence": "medium",
  "notes": "Edge connector drawn as two columns, letters A-Z (no G, I, O, Q) beside numbers 1-22; each column carries its own label, so the letter and number contacts are recorded as separate contacts. Where both sides carry the same label the two contacts form one port (keyed a = letter side, b = number side, polarity not marked on the drawing). Operator and producer mic inputs, talkback OUTPUT, OUT 1-4 with CTL 1-4, OSC CTL, power. CTL n taken as control inputs selecting OUT n, MUTE CTL as a control output (mutes monitors during talkback) - both inferred, not written. Size A, DATE SEPT 77, ISS 2, checked (signature). Legend: NC not connected."
